OL,17,     GKate Molleson and Gillian Moore
OL,18,     Gshine new light on the 'modern'
OL,19,     Gmusic of the 20th century. This
OL,20,     Gweek, Kate explores the
OL,21,     Gexperimental sound environments
OL,22,     Gof Alvin Lucier.
